@node Main "Velox %VERSION%"

@{b}Velox %VERSION%@{ub}
A small, fast web browser for AmigaOS 3.x, written in 68k assembly.

   @{" Introduction       " link Intro}   What Velox is
   @{" Requirements       " link Requirements}   What it needs
   @{" Installing         " link Installing}   Where it goes
   @{" Starting           " link Starting}   From Workbench and from a Shell
   @{" Settings           " link Settings}   Tool types and variables

   @{" The window         " link Window}   Toolbar, tab strip, page, status line
   @{" Keys               " link Keys}   Everything from the keyboard
   @{" The mouse          " link Mouse}   Links, tabs, selecting text
   @{" Tabs               " link Tabs}   Several pages at once
   @{" Bookmarks and more " link Bookmarks}   Bookmarks, cookies, downloads, caches

   @{" https and the proxy" link Https}   Secure pages, with or without AmiSSL
   @{" What Velox shows   " link Features}   HTML, CSS, images, frames, forms
